https://mizjeannie.com/spells-workings/paper-folding-spell-for-cleansing-a-secondhand-ritual-tool&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait black-and-muted-pink reference card with readable cream text, complete spell instructions and caution, and a woodland tabletop scene featuring a brass bell, pen, candle, books, and mug. The gold botanical mountain-and-river watermark at bottom right matches the supplied reference." height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af5df6577eca.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 15:46:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>清晨上学路上的日出美景</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5cd05452d9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;嗨，omg.lol社区！拥有地址两年后第一次在这里发帖，只是想分享一张我2026年10月28日早上6点20分去上大学路上拍的日出照片，这是我拍过的最好的一张照片。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Hi omg.lol community! First time posting here after having an address for 2 years, Just wanted to share a sunrise pic that I took when I am heading to college on the morning of 28th October 2026, 6:20 AM, one of the best picture that I took" height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/patin/6af5cd05452d9.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://patin.some.pics"&gt;@patin&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:28:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奇异野兽混入烤炉</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5ccd560802</link><description>&lt;p&gt;奇怪的野兽在烘焙机中混入&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Strange Beasts blend in the roaster " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/birdbutt/6af5ccd560802.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://birdbutt.some.pics"&gt;@birdbutt&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:27:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>鸟臀豆新一批单一产地烘焙</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5cc752ecf2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;鸟臀豆：烘焙机中的新一批单一产地咖啡豆&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Bird Butt Beans: new batch of single origin in the roaster " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jonesy/6af5cc752ecf2.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jonesy.some.pics"&gt;@jonesy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:26:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国软管消防公司</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5c8413ac43</link><description>&lt;p&gt;美国软管消防公司&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Red brick firehouse with arched windows and doors, text reading AMERICAN HOSE COMPANY and dates 1878 1881." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jmock/6af5c8413ac43.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jmock.some.pics"&gt;@jmock&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:08:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>共同仪式凝聚友谊</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5c33082c57</link><description>&lt;p&gt;共同的仪式能体现每个参与者的心意。当你和朋友一起策划时，你们可以共同斟酌措辞，或各自提出有意义的内容。你们能一起创造出单凭个人无法企及的东西。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-and-rose fantasy scene of three witches contributing handwritten slips around a wooden courtyard table, with climbing roses, candles, a sleeping black cat, and floating steps leading to a garden within an enormous crescent. Ivory serif lettering spans the upper arch, and a gold emblem sits at bottom-right. Text: A shared ritual can reflect everyone taking part. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af5c33082c57.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:46:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Moc Runner</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5a82734a0d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Moc Runner&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Grey" height="757" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6af5a82734a0d.jpg" width="1068"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:51:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>时尚穿搭分享</title><link>https://some.pics/6af5a76f4a757</link><description>&lt;p&gt;造型设计&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Styling " height="1080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/selah/6af5a76f4a757.webp" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://selah.some.pics"&gt;@selah&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 11:48:01 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>